# attestation.json is DELIBERATELY not excluded. It is a 2 KB committed artefact, the authority
# the server checks the snapshot against before serving anything, and a 2,000-line answer is
# strictly worse than the four anchors. Excluding it shipped an image whose corpus was 2 records.
# `data/corpus.db` is likewise NOT excluded: it is gitignored rather than un-buildable, so a local
# `docker build` embeds the exact attested snapshot, and a cloud build — which clones from git and
# therefore has no database to copy — rebuilds it from the pinned registry URLs. See the Dockerfile.
# The SQLite sidecars stay excluded: they are transient, written whenever the DB is opened outside
# WAL mode, and shipping them is shipping a rollback journal.
data/corpus.db-shm
data/corpus.db-wal
data/corpus.db-journal
data/raw
data/registry/records.jsonl
